# Performance and profiling tests
# The generated `jobs/*.yaml`, `inputs/*.input` and `src/utils/config.hh` now land in the build
#  directory, so they no longer need an ignore rule here. In-source copies left by an older checkout
#  are deleted by `tests-integration/CMakeLists.txt` at configure time.
tests-integration/pycobench.tasks
tests-integration/results/*.csv
tests-integration/results/*.out
tests-integration/results/*.output

